<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's NLCF passes on tenders for feed wheat.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's NLCF passes on tenders for feed wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Cooperatives Federation (NLCF) passed on tenders for 105,000 tonnes of feed wheat due to high prices, traders said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Traders said the tenders were divided into two lots: 52,500 tonnes for arrival on March 5 and 52,500 tonnes for arrival on June 15.</p>
<p>They said arrival was set for Inchon and one of three ports -- Ulsan, Pusan and Kunsan.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
